**/.packages
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/
**/app.*.symbols
**/app.*.map.json

# Android
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/captures/
**/android/local.properties
**/android/key.properties

# iOS / macOS
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
**/ios/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/.symlinks/
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/

# Web
**/web/.dart_tool/

# Windows / Linux desktop runners (generated)
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/linux/flutter/ephemeral/

